-- the shapes the audit still listed: statement chaining, the when-fallbacks, and the
-- direction forms of walk / face / stop walking
player is {x: 20, y: 20}
score is 8
halve score and halve score
walk player right
stop walking player
face player left
when key is in ["a", "b"]
  score is score + 1
when "c" or "d" is pressed
  score is score + 2
